WEBVTT

00:00:59.766 --> 00:01:01.422
you would all be able to do this.

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:05.582
(Laughter)

00:01:07.216 --> 00:01:08.795
(Laughter ends)

00:01:08.819 --> 00:01:10.326
Now you can see how easy it is

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:12.976
for me to manipulate the human mind,
once you know how.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.683
(Laughter)

00:01:15.707 --> 00:01:17.945
Now, I remember when I was about 15,

00:01:17.969 --> 00:01:19.539
(Laughter)

00:01:19.563 --> 00:01:21.482
I read a copy of Life magazine,

00:01:21.506 --> 00:01:26.345
which detailed a story
about a 75-year-old blind Russian woman

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:28.092
who could sense printed letters --

00:01:28.116 --> 00:01:29.988
there's still people trying to do it --